EN:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Shouldn't you be out there finding
the rest of us, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
You'll lose if you don't!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Perché non stai cercando chi è
ancora nascosto, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Non vorrai mica perdere...

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Solltest du nicht auch noch die
anderen suchen, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Sonst verlierst du noch!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Dışarıda diğerlerimizi bulman gerekmiyor mu,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
